Because \R does not distinguish between a scalar and a vector of length 1, a
length-1 vector like \code{c(42)} is written to JSON as a scalar (\code{42}) rather
than an array (\verb{[42]}). If a Stan variable is declared as a vector or array
that may have length 1, wrap the value in \code{\link[=array]{array()}} to force array output.
